{"unit_id": "tag:02J6:statement", "translation": "下列各类概形（schemes）都是雅各布森（Jacobson）的。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 在域（field）上局部有限型（locally of finite type）的任意概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 在<MATH_0001>上局部有限型（locally of finite type）的任意概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 在具有无穷多个素理想（primes）的<MATH_0002>维（dimensional）诺特整环（Noetherian domain）上局部有限型（locally of finite type）的任意概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0005> 形如<MATH_0003>的概形（scheme），其中<MATH_0004>是诺特局部环（Noetherian local ring）。在其上局部有限型（locally of finite type）的任意概形（scheme）也在此列。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "primes", "target_term": "素理想"}, {"source_term": "dimensional", "target_term": "维"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian domain", "target_term": "诺特整环"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian local ring", "target_term": "诺特局部环"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "分类所涉及的对象"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森", "context": "列举的各类概形的共同性质"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "第一类概形的基底"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "第一类概形在域上的条件"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第一类所列对象"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "第二类概形在指定基底上的条件"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context