{"unit_id": "tag:02J6:proof", "translation": "下文将直接使用引理<REF_0001>，不再说明。\n域（field）的谱（spectrum）显然是雅各布森（Jacobson）的。\n<MATH_0001>的谱（spectrum）是雅各布森（Jacobson）的，见代数（Algebra）一章的引理<REF_0002>。\n关于（3），见代数（Algebra）一章的引理<REF_0003>。\n关于（4），见性质（Properties）一章的引理<REF_0004>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "第一种情形下取谱的环"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱", "context": "第一种情形的域的谱"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森", "context": "域的谱的性质"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱", "context": "第二种情形的指定对象的谱"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森", "context": "第二种情形的谱的性质"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "第二种情形所引引理的章名"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "第三种情形所引引理的章名"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质", "context": "第四种情形所引引理的章名"}], "notes": []}
