{"unit_id": "tag:02J7:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n回顾一下，拓扑空间（topological space）<MATH_0001>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>链状（catenary）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的，条件是对每一对不可约（irreducible）闭子集（closed subsets）<MATH_0002>，都存在由不可约（irreducible）闭子集（closed subsets）组成的极大（maximal）链（chain）<MATH_0003>，且所有这样的链（chain）具有相同的长度（length）。见拓扑学（Topology）一章的定义<REF_0001>。\n回顾一下，如果一个概形（scheme）的底层（underlying）拓扑空间（topological space）是链状（catenary）的，就称该概形是链状（catenary）的。见性质（Properties）一章的定义<REF_0002>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "maximal", "target_term": "极大"}, {"source_term": "chain", "target_term": "链"}, {"source_term": "chain", "target_term": "链"}, {"source_term": "length", "target_term": "长度"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "underlying", "target_term": "底层"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "所回顾定义的对象"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状", "context": "定义的拓扑空间性质"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约", "context": "修饰作为端点的一对子集"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "作为端点的一对子集"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约", "context": "修饰构成链的各子集"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "构成极大链的各子集"}, {"source_term": "maximal", "target_term": "极大", "context": "链在包含关系下的极大性"}, {"source_term": "chain", "target_term": "链", "context": "在给定端点之间的极大链"}, {"source_term": "chain", "target_term": "链", "context": "用来比较长度的任一此类链"}, {"source_term": "length", "target_term": "长度", "context": "各链互相比较的量"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "被引定义所在的章名"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "借助其底层空间定义链状性的对象"}, {"source_term": "underlying", "target_term": "底层", "context": "修饰概形所带的拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "概形的底层空间"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状", "context": "底层拓扑空间满足的性质"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状", "context": "由底层空间的性质定义的概形性质"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质", "context": "被引定义所在的章名"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02J8:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。假设<MATH_0002>是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）的。\n称<MATH_0003>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>普遍链状（universally catenary）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的，条件是对每个局部有限型（locally of finite type）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>，概形（scheme）<MATH_0005>都是链状（catenary）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义所针对的对象"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "定义对基概形的假设"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状", "context": "本段定义的概形性质"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "全称量词所及态射的条件"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "普遍链状性定义中量化的态射"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义要求具有链状性的对象"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状", "context": "定义对相应概形规定的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02J7:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这是比链状（catenary）性“更好”的概念，因为存在诺特（Noetherian）概形（schemes），它们是链状（catenary）的，却不是普遍链状（universally catenary）的。见例（Examples）一章的节<REF_0001>。\n许多概形（schemes）是普遍链状（universally catenary）的，见下文的引理<REF_0002>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n回顾一下，环（ring）<MATH_0001>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>链状（catenary）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的，条件是对任意一对素（prime）理想（ideals）<MATH_0002>，都存在由素理想（primes）组成的极大（maximal）链（chain）<MATH_0003>，且所有这样的链都具有相同的长度（length）。见代数（Algebra）一章的定义<REF_0003>。\n我们在性质（Properties）一章的节<REF_0004>中已经看到链状（catenary）概形（schemes）与链状（catenary）环（rings）之间的关系。\n回顾一下，环（ring）<MATH_0004>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>普遍链状（universally catenary）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>的，条件是<MATH_0005>是诺特（Noetherian）的，且对每个有限型（finite type）环同态（ring map）<MATH_0006>，环（ring）<MATH_0007>都是链状（catenary）的。见代数（Algebra）一章的定义<REF_0005>。\n代数几何（algebraic geometry）中出现的许多有趣的环（rings）都满足这一性质。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状"}, {"source_term": "Examples", "target_term": "例"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素"}, {"source_term": "ideals", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "primes", "target_term": "素理想"}, {"source_term": "maximal", "target_term": "极大"}, {"source_term": "chain", "target_term": "链"}, {"source_term": "length", "target_term": "长度"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "algebraic geometry", "target_term": "代数几何"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状", "context": "用来与普遍链状性比较的性质"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "修饰用来比较两种性质的概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "满足链状性但不满足普遍链状性的对象"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状", "context": "上述诺特概形具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状", "context": "上述诺特概形不具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "Examples", "target_term": "例", "context": "被引小节所在的章名"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "下一引理所涉及的对象"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状", "context": "许多概形具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "这一定义的对象"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状", "context": "所回顾的环的性质"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素", "context": "修饰作为端点的一对理想"}, {"source_term": "ideals", "target_term": "理想", "context": "作为链端点的一对素理想"}, {"source_term": "primes", "target_term": "素理想", "context": "构成链的各素理想"}, {"source_term": "maximal", "target_term": "极大", "context": "链在包含关系下的极大性"}, {"source_term": "chain", "target_term": "链", "context": "给定一对素理想间的极大链"}, {"source_term": "length", "target_term": "长度", "context": "各极大链之间所比较的量"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "环的链状性定义所在的章名"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质", "context": "讨论环与概形相关性质的章名"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状", "context": "所提概形的性质"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所提关系的一侧"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状", "context": "所提环的性质"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "所提关系的另一侧"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "普遍链状性定义所针对的对象"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状", "context": "所回顾的环的性质"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "普遍链状环必须满足的性质"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "定义中对环同态所加的限制"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "定义中量化的同态"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "给定同态的目标环"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状", "context": "对目标环要求的性质"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "环的普遍链状性定义所在的章名"}, {"source_term": "algebraic geometry", "target_term": "代数几何", "context": "若干满足此性质的环出现的领域"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "满足上一性质的诸例"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02J9:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（scheme）。下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002>是普遍链状（universally catenary）的，\n<STRUCT_0003> 存在<MATH_0003>的一个开（open）覆盖（covering），其每个成员都是普遍链状（universally catenary）概形（schemes），\n<STRUCT_0004> 对每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0004>，环（ring）<MATH_0005>都是普遍链状（universally catenary）的，\n<STRUCT_0005> 存在一个仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0006>，使得每个<MATH_0007>都是某个普遍链状（universally catenary）环（ring）的谱（spectrum）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n此外，在这种情形下，任意概形（scheme）只要在<MATH_0008>上局部有限型（locally of finite type），也都是普遍链状（universally catenary）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "引理对基概形的假设"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理讨论的基底"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "列出的各项条件彼此等价"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状", "context": "第一项所述性质"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "第二项覆盖由开集构成"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "第二项要求存在的覆盖"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状", "context": "第二项对各成员的要求"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第二项覆盖的各成员"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "第三项量化的开子概形"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "第三项各仿射开集对应的环"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状", "context": "第三项各环所满足的性质"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开", "context": "修饰第四项的覆盖"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "第四项要求存在的覆盖"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状", "context": "第四项由各成员的对应环满足的性质"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "第四项中取谱的对象"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱", "context": "第四项用环描述覆盖成员"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "附加结论中量化的对象"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "附加结论中对结构态射的要求"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状", "context": "附加结论所断言的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02J9:proof", "translation": "由引理<REF_0001>，开浸入（open immersion）是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的。局部有限型（locally of finite type）的态射（morphisms）的复合（composition）仍是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的（引理<REF_0002>）。因此，若<MATH_0001>是普遍链状（universally catenary）的，则显然，任意开集（open）以及在<MATH_0002>上局部有限型（locally of finite type）的任意概形（scheme）也都是普遍链状（universally catenary）的。这证明了引理的最后一个断言，也证明了（1）蕴含（2）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n若<MATH_0003>是普遍链状（universally catenary）概形（scheme），则对每个概形（scheme）<MATH_0004>，只要<MATH_0005>是有限型（finite type）<MATH_0006>-代数（algebra），该概形就是链状（catenary）的。因此所有这些环（rings）<MATH_0007>都是链状（catenary）的，这是由代数（Algebra）一章的引理<REF_0003>得出的。\n于是<MATH_0008>是普遍链状（universally catenary）的。结合上面的说明可知，（1）蕴含（3），且（2）蕴含（4）。当然，（3）显然蕴含（4）。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n最后证明（4）蕴含（1）。\n假设（4）成立，并设<MATH_0009>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的态射（morphism）。\n可以找到仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0010>，使得每个<MATH_0011>都映射（maps）到诸<MATH_0012>中的某一个之中。由引理<REF_0004>，诱导的环同态（ring map）<MATH_0013>是有限型（finite type）的。因此<MATH_0014>是链状（catenary）的。于是<MATH_0015>也是链状（catenary）的，这是由性质（Properties）一章的引理<REF_0005>得出的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "catenary", "target_term": "链状"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "第一处应用所引引理的态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "开浸入具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "参与复合的态射具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "参与复合的对象"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "由多个态射形成新态射的运算"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "复合所得态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状", "context": "对基底的假设"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "从基底继承性质的任意开集"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "概形在基底上的条件"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "从基底继承性质的另一类对象"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状", "context": "开集及局部有限型概形继承的性质"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍链状", "context": "第二段对给定概形的假设"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第二段作为基底的对象"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "cont