{"unit_id": "tag:035A:proof", "translation": "关于“普遍日本（universally Japanese）”的结论，由代数（Algebra）一章的引理<REF_0001>得出。\n关于“永田（Nagata）”的结论，由代数（Algebra）一章的命题<REF_0002>得出。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "universally Japanese", "target_term": "普遍日本"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "Nagata", "target_term": "永田"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "universally Japanese", "target_term": "普遍日本", "context": "第一处引文所支持的那项性质"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "第一处所引引理所在的章名"}, {"source_term": "Nagata", "target_term": "永田", "context": "第二处引文所支持的那项性质"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "第二处所引命题所在的章名"}], "notes": []}
