{"unit_id": "tag:07R2:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们寻求一个判据，以保证对任意在基底（base）上局部有限型（locally of finite type）的概形（scheme），其正则点集（regular locus）都具有开性（openness）。下面给出定义。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "regular locus", "target_term": "正则点集"}, {"source_term": "openness", "target_term": "开性"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底", "context": "一切所论概形的共同基底"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "所论概形在基底上的条件"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "判据应适用的任意对象"}, {"source_term": "regular locus", "target_term": "正则点集", "context": "判据旨在保证为开的点集"}, {"source_term": "openness", "target_term": "开性", "context": "所求判据应推出的性质"}], "notes": []}
